                      "description": "Fyrden: why \`mergeable\` is null while open. \`pending\`: not worked out yet; \`too_expensive\`: past the budgets for working it out in the background (merging may still succeed); \`unreadable\`: an object it needs could not be read. The last two are worked out again after a delay (10 minutes, doubling to 6 hours), and at once when the base tip or head moves. Null once known, and once closed.",
